1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 36]</font>

15
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince's Residence]</font>

16
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:21,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

17
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in.</font>

18
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

19
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've caught the man in the portrait.</font>

20
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He nearly snuck
into the Chengtian Sect last night.</font>

21
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our men caught him.</font>

22
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Chengtian Sect, as expected.</font>

23
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:36,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But one thing is odd.</font>

24
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's odd?</font>

25
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His eyes are perfectly fine.</font>

26
00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No sign of the red eye disease.</font>

27
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's still no cure</font>

28
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the red eye disease.</font>

29
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did his eyes heal, then?</font>

30
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday was yours; today is mine.</font>

31
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now you must cooperate with me.</font>

32
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

33
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do you want me to cooperate?</font>

34
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want to wander around.</font>

35
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

36
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:17,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I haven't told you to speak,</font>

37
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">keep your mouth shut.</font>

38
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just like before.</font>

39
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your way is the only way.</font>

40
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it. I'll placate him for now,</font>

41
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lest he snap the rope.</font>

42
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:52,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

43
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince's Residence
is heavily guarded.</font>

44
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">While you're inside,</font>

45
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">find a way to map their defenses.</font>

46
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'll help you escape later.</font>

47
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The people here</font>

48
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have absolutely no manners.</font>

49
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They leave junk all over the walkway.</font>

50
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He even forgot the Blissful Union Pot.</font>

51
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How am I supposed to cure him?</font>

52
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

53
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm tired. Let's go over there.</font>

54
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

55
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:31,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's only been one night,</font>

56
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you can't even speak now?</font>

57
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,
what did you do to Qinglan?</font>

58
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:36,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

59
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's truly forgotten everything.</font>

60
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That demoness is formidable.</font>

61
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's a soul-stealing vixen.</font>

62
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What will you do next?</font>

63
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Time is short. It's already Day 2.</font>

64
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

65
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:39,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me prepare
some Kongming Lanterns.</font>

66
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">True gold fears no fire.</font>

67
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">True love defeats sorcery.</font>

68
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I win him over step by step,</font>

69
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'll surely come to his senses.</font>

70
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I support you. Hard work pays off.</font>

71
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. I must try hard too.</font>

72
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I refuse to be beaten by this.</font>

73
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where do I start?</font>

74
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where should I begin?</font>

75
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:54,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be nervous.</font>

76
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be gentle.</font>

77
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just bear with it.</font>

78
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Relax.</font>

79
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be gentle.</font>

80
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

81
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have something to say.</font>

82
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

83
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You planted the poison in me</font>

84
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because your love was unrequited.</font>

85
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:26,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I hate most</font>

86
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is people groveling before me,</font>

87
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">putting on hypocritical airs.</font>

88
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao, you scoundrel!</font>

89
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:58,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince's Residence]</font>

90
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:26,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait a moment.</font>

91
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is that dancing woman?</font>

92
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inspector Lin</font>

93
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">brought his daughter to visit today.</font>

94
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His wedding was barely days ago,</font>

95
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he's already flirting
with other women.</font>

96
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai,</font>

97
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll settle with you later.</font>

98
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forgive my clumsy performance.</font>

99
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Lin,
your dancing is truly graceful.</font>

100
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My daughter's long admired you.</font>

101
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dancing for you today</font>

102
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has fulfilled a long-held wish of hers.</font>

103
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Lan,</font>

104
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:13,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">toast the Fourth Prince.</font>

105
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, to you.</font>

106
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Read more, and you'll know honor;</font>

107
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drink less, and you'll avoid trouble.</font>

108
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You taught me that.</font>

109
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Your Highness.</font>

110
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:39,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Your Highness.</font>

111
00:09:41,800 --> 00:09:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Lin's dance</font>

112
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was impressive.</font>

113
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not</font>

114
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dance another one?</font>

115
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She dares not dance before you.</font>

116
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why can't she dance?</font>

117
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She can dance before the Prince.</font>

118
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before the Consort,</font>

119
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she must dance.</font>

120
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly!</font>

121
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know a little about dancing myself.</font>

122
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come, spar with me.</font>

123
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Splendid!</font>

124
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look how well she dances!</font>

125
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See that sleeve wheel!</font>

126
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Spin, spin, spin...</font>

127
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She caught her!</font>

128
00:10:58,680 --> 00:10:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, you mustn't!</font>

129
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:00,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See? Now, it's a duet!</font>

130
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch out!</font>

131
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:05,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

132
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Consort is lively.</font>

133
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inspector Lin,
please don't take offense.</font>

134
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's all for today.</font>

135
00:11:12,640 --> 00:11:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shall take my leave.</font>

136
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:17,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't had my fill of dancing.</font>

137
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Afraid you can't match me?</font>

138
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Consort is tired.</font>

139
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:21,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards.</font>

140
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Escort the Consort to her chambers.</font>

141
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to escort me.</font>

142
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

143
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your dancing was wonderful.</font>

144
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai, a word with you.</font>

145
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever it is,</font>

146
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just say it here.</font>

147
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai,</font>

148
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have I not told you before?</font>

149
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's my only sister.</font>

150
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her feelings for you are genuine.</font>

151
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you seek revenge against my family,</font>

152
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come at me directly.</font>

153
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you bully my sister.</font>

154
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Marrying her, then chasing a vixen.</font>

155
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What were you thinking?</font>

156
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me be clear.</font>

157
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got 300 subordinates.</font>

158
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan,</font>

159
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll handle my own affairs.</font>

160
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:09,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying, what are you doing?</font>

161
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying, don't do anything foolish.</font>

162
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Stay out of this. Leave!
- Jiang Ying, listen to me.</font>

163
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were never that bright.</font>

164
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mustn't do anything rash.</font>

165
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying, hear me out.</font>

166
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai.</font>

167
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you.</font>

168
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

169
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">300 subordinates.</font>

170
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In Yunshan Town,</font>

171
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was the one who stood you up.</font>

172
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father destroyed your family.</font>

173
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you resent me for it,</font>

174
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why not hit me with this to vent?</font>

175
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just once?</font>

176
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Twice.</font>

177
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hit me as many times as you like.</font>

178
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then,</font>

179
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's settled.</font>

180
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only my head.</font>

181
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not my face!</font>

182
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you have a problem, come at me...</font>

183
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:21,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't even tell liking
from disliking.</font>

184
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I bear to hit your head?</font>

185
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This public display of affection</font>

186
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">came out of nowhere.</font>

187
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:52,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

188
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you keep heading north,</font>

189
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:56,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll reach Guanzhou.</font>

190
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The border of Beiyuan.</font>

191
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:02,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The two of us</font>

192
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">grew up together in Guanzhou.</font>

193
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then,</font>

194
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were the dashing Young General,</font>

195
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I was the Governor's daughter.</font>

196
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:12,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone called us a golden couple,</font>

197
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a match made in heaven.</font>

198
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Farther north</font>

199
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lies the capital, Yanjing.</font>

200
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:20,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There,</font>

201
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were the legendary Prince,</font>

202
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while I had become a mere coroner</font>

203
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who dealt with corpses all day.</font>

204
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who would have thought back then</font>

205
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we would end up together again?</font>

206
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:34,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet you recklessly went your own way.</font>

207
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:36,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've forgotten everything you said.</font>

208
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No,</font>

209
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you haven't forgotten.</font>

210
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's getting late.</font>

211
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:46,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's head back.</font>

212
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

213
00:14:52,160 --> 00:14:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't always look like this.</font>

214
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My face was cut on our wedding day.</font>

215
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fled the General's Mansion</font>

216
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and fell off a cliff,</font>

217
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Mother found me.</font>

218
00:15:03,880 --> 00:15:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From Qin Wei, I became Jun Qinglan.</font>

219
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought</font>

220
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the rest of my life
would pass like that.</font>

221
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was you</font>

222
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who made me Qin Wei again.</font>

223
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whether you're Congyao</font>

224
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:18,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or Prince Duan,</font>

225
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you never gave up on me.</font>

226
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could you possibly forget?</font>

227
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm warning you.</font>

228
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you want to die, don't drag me down.</font>

229
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once this Bloodlure Poison is cured,</font>

230
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:34,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go die wherever you like.</font>

231
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not afraid to die, right?</font>

232
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then untie this rope right now.</font>

233
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll jump down at once.</font>

234
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I die, you won't live either.</font>

235
00:15:42,640 --> 00:15:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei.</font>

236
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't push me.</font>

237
00:15:58,600 --> 00:15:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Under the Kongming Lantern,</font>

238
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a blissful union.</font>

239
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still remember?</font>

240
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

241
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">did you remember something?</font>

242
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Life's partings and reunions
are like this.</font>

243
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's enjoy the time we have together.</font>

244
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If everyone thought the way you do,</font>

245
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then not a moment of joy would remain.</font>

246
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

247
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">did you remember something?</font>

248
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

249
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you all right?</font>

250
00:16:41,040 --> 00:16:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get away from me.</font>

251
00:16:43,760 --> 00:16:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

252
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:45,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't come closer.</font>

253
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sure you saw it right?</font>

254
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw it with my own eyes.</font>

255
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may go now.</font>

256
00:16:58,440 --> 00:16:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

257
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qingzhi.</font>

258
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring me the Soul-Locking Bell.</font>

259
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You intend to use the Bell to...</font>

260
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling must never be swayed by her.</font>

261
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He must be mine,</font>

262
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:11,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">completely and utterly.</font>

263
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:14,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

264
00:17:15,270 --> 00:17:16,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

265
00:17:16,940 --> 00:17:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

266
00:17:20,860 --> 00:17:25,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

267
00:17:25,540 --> 00:17:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

268
00:17:29,530 --> 00:17:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

269
00:17:34,050 --> 00:17:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

270
00:17:38,380 --> 00:17:44,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

271
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:50,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

272
00:17:51,190 --> 00:17:54,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

273
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:59,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

274
00:17:59,790 --> 00:18:02,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

275
00:18:03,760 --> 00:18:07,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

276
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:12,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
